{
  "_comment": [
    "Text-to-video via Wan 2.2 TI2V-5B - same model, checkpoint and node graph",
    "as wan-ti2v-5b-image-to-video.json, just without a starting image: no",
    "LoadImage node, and Wan22ImageToVideoLatent's optional start_image input",
    "is simply omitted rather than wired. Per ComfyUI's own official template",
    "comments (Comfy-Org/workflow_templates), that node's start_image input is",
    "genuinely optional - omitted, TI2V-5B starts purely from noise/text,",
    "which is the documented T2V behavior for this exact node, not a guess.",
    "",
    "ModelSamplingSD3 (shift=8) still required, same reason as the I2V file.",
    "VHS_VideoCombine kept for the same reason (matches existing polling code).",
    "",
    "UNVERIFIED end-to-end, same caveat as every other workflow file here -",
    "test one short clip before trusting it for a real episode.",
    "",
    "REQUIRES the same 3 model files as wan-ti2v-5b-image-to-video.json (no",
    "clip_vision needed, same as that file):",
    "  1. wan2.2_ti2v_5B model in models/diffusion_models/",
    "  2. umt5_xxl text encoder in models/text_encoders/",
    "  3. wan2.2_vae.safetensors in models/vae/",
    "  4. ComfyUI-VideoHelperSuite custom node pack"
  ],
  "1": {
    "class_type": "UNETLoader",
    "inputs": {
      "unet_name": "{{CHECKPOINT}}",
      "weight_dtype": "default"
    }
  },
  "2": {
    "class_type": "ModelSamplingSD3",
    "inputs": {
      "model": ["1", 0],
      "shift": 8
    }
  },
  "3": {
    "class_type": "CLIPLoader",
    "inputs": {
      "clip_name": "{{CLIP_MODEL}}",
      "type": "wan"
    }
  },
  "4": {
    "class_type": "CLIPTextEncode",
    "inputs": {
      "clip": ["3", 0],
      "text": "{{POSITIVE_PROMPT}}"
    }
  },
  "5": {
    "class_type": "CLIPTextEncode",
    "inputs": {
      "clip": ["3", 0],
      "text": "{{NEGATIVE_PROMPT}}"
    }
  },
  "6": {
    "class_type": "VAELoader",
    "inputs": {
      "vae_name": "{{VAE_MODEL}}"
    }
  },
  "8": {
    "class_type": "Wan22ImageToVideoLatent",
    "inputs": {
      "vae": ["6", 0],
      "width": "{{WIDTH}}",
      "height": "{{HEIGHT}}",
      "length": "{{LENGTH}}",
      "batch_size": 1
    }
  },
  "9": {
    "class_type": "KSampler",
    "inputs": {
      "model": ["2", 0],
      "positive": ["4", 0],
      "negative": ["5", 0],
      "latent_image": ["8", 0],
      "seed": "{{SEED}}",
      "steps": "{{STEPS}}",
      "cfg": "{{CFG}}",
      "sampler_name": "{{SAMPLER}}",
      "scheduler": "{{SCHEDULER}}",
      "denoise": 1
    }
  },
  "10": {
    "class_type": "VAEDecode",
    "inputs": {
      "samples": ["9", 0],
      "vae": ["6", 0]
    }
  },
  "11": {
    "class_type": "VHS_VideoCombine",
    "inputs": {
      "images": ["10", 0],
      "frame_rate": "{{FPS}}",
      "loop_count": 0,
      "filename_prefix": "{{FILENAME_PREFIX}}",
      "format": "video/h264-mp4",
      "pix_fmt": "yuv420p",
      "crf": 20,
      "save_output": true,
      "pingpong": false
    }
  }
}
